WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,540 --> 00:00:03,540
Junior Brother Chu

2
00:00:03,820 --> 00:00:05,820
Otherwise, you won’t participate if this is a big deal.

3
00:00:05,820 --> 00:00:07,260
Develop good medical strength first

4
00:00:07,260 --> 00:00:08,380
Yes, Master

5
00:00:08,380 --> 00:00:10,740
Anyway, you have been appointed as a disciple by Elder Danyangzi.

6
00:00:10,740 --> 00:00:12,380
It’s nothing in Jinwaimen in 2011

7
00:00:12,380 --> 00:00:14,500
It will still be some time before the big event can be held again

8
00:00:14,960 --> 00:00:16,520
My injury could be better

9
00:00:16,520 --> 00:00:20,240
I'll see if I can participate then, okay?

10
00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:21,760
Then take good care of yourself

11
00:00:21,760 --> 00:00:23,240
Don't force yourself

12
00:00:23,240 --> 00:00:38,600
We will leave first, junior brother

13
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:40,720
I drank medicine, senior sister

14
00:00:41,260 --> 00:00:42,620
How many nights are left today?

15
00:00:42,620 --> 00:00:43,780
It's the last night

16
00:00:43,780 --> 00:00:45,620
It's not that bitter since honey is added to it.
